Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(example): Nextcloud storage connector (Login Flow
 v2, WebDAV)

Connect any Nextcloud server (murena.io by default) with Login Flow v2: the app password stays on the server, Disconnect deletes it on Nextcloud. Browse (PROPFIND), recent files (SEARCH), open through signed download and callback URLs, save back with If-Match (conflict copy on 412, retry on 423), new document, upload.

